#: ../../zh/triton_api/Extension_Ops/compile_hint.md:5
msgid ""
"`compile_hint` 是一个编译器提示（hint）机制，允许用户为张量附加元数据信息，这些信息会被传递到编译器后端，用于指导优化和代码生成。"
msgstr ""
"`compile_hint` is a compiler hint mechanism that allows users to attach "
"metadata to tensors, which is then passed to the compiler backend to guide "
"optimization and code generation."

